{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.ForceCarrierIntertwiningCorrespondence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.ForceCarrierIntertwiningCorrespondence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.GCD.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.force_carrier_intertwining_correspondence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.force_carrier_intertwining_correspondence","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/force-carrier-intertwining-correspondence.lean#L48-L59","doc":"The intertwining-pattern shape of `T_{p,q}` on `n` strands is the\npartition `(p, 1, …, 1)` with one part `p` and `n − p` unit parts.\nIts parts sum to `n`, so it is a genuine partition of `n` — the\narithmetic precondition for the Wedderburn channel\n`V_{(p, 1^{n-p})}`. (Coprimality `gcd p q = 1` selects the torus\nknot `T(p,q)`; it is recorded as a hypothesis but not needed for\nthe partition-sum fact.) ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:force-carrier-intertwining-correspondence","label":"prop:force-carrier-intertwining-correspondence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/force-carrier-intertwining-correspondence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}